The Huntik team travelled in a Foundation Cabin Cruiser to travel across the [[Aegean Sea]] on their mission to find the [[Argo]]. On their journey, they began to relax and enjoyed water-skiing. However the boat's engine was badly damaged by an obscure and toxic plant life, forcing them to take a detour to [[Madea Island]] whilst they made repairs. {{source|The Beautiful Trap}} After repairing the boat, the team travelled on to Sutos, narrowly avoiding being crushed by two moving cliffs. {{source|Like Father, Unlike Son}}

Dante used the Foundation boat to travel to the [[Sea of Cortés]] in the midst of dangerous storm whilst searching for [[Hernán Cortés' vault]]. {{source|Gremlow Infestation!}} 

